---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Funding transparency">
  <section style="padding:2.5rem 0 1rem; max-width:70ch;">
    <h1>Funding transparency</h1>
    <p class="lede">No verified funding relationships have been recorded yet.</p>
    <p>A funding relationship is published only when we can link to a public disclosure: a foundation grant announcement, an SEC filing, a fellowship roster, a reporter's own disclosure note or a comparable primary document. Each entry names the funder, the recipient, the relationship type, and the evidence URL.</p>
    <p>A funding relationship is a factual link between a funder and a recipient. It is <em>not</em> evidence of editorial influence over any specific article. We do not connect funders to individual stories unless the funder itself disclosed support for that specific story.</p>
    <p>See <a href="/methodology">Methodology</a> for how we handle funding data.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
